                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 13 in No. 349.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Copy of telegram from Lowell, Minister, London, to
                        Barrows, United States Consul, Dublin, dated April 27</hi>, 1882.</head>
                <p>You will of course understand that the offer mentioned in my letter of
                    twenty-first is now absolutely withdrawn.</p>
